{"audio_filepath": "https://konkanicollector-production.up.railway.app/api/recordings/110/audio", "text": "मांड्कांगलि सवारी भाय्राय्लि पोळोनु वीज़ु!", "duration": 5.165}
{"audio_filepath": "https://konkanicollector-production.up.railway.app/api/recordings/111/audio", "text": "बाग्ला खांचेन्थाव्नु आयिलें भित्तरि उदाक....", "duration": 4.0775}
{"audio_filepath": "https://konkanicollector-production.up.railway.app/api/recordings/112/audio", "text": "ज़ाल्यारि स्वथागले भावनांक तान्ने सोणि वार्याक!", "duration": 5.5075}
{"audio_filepath": "https://konkanicollector-production.up.railway.app/api/recordings/113/audio", "text": "भवानीशङ्कर देवाचेरि तागलो आश्शिलो इत्लो विश्वासु", "duration": 5.6125}
{"audio_filepath": "https://konkanicollector-production.up.railway.app/api/recordings/114/audio", "text": "गोत्तशिलें ताका देवागले एक स्पर्षाने वत्ता वरुणागले आक्रोषु", "duration": 6.9125}
{"audio_filepath": "https://konkanicollector-production.up.railway.app/api/recordings/115/audio", "text": "उदाक निःशब्द भर्लें सग्ळे घरान्तु", "duration": 4.7825}
{"audio_filepath": "https://konkanicollector-production.up.railway.app/api/recordings/116/audio", "text": "बब्रुलिंगप्पा ज़ाडारि चोणु बस्लो घड्यांतु!", "duration": 4.4625}
{"audio_filepath": "https://konkanicollector-production.up.railway.app/api/recordings/117/audio", "text": "पळय्नाशिल वारि केल्लें तान्नें शेज़ार्चांक", "duration": 4.42}
{"audio_filepath": "https://konkanicollector-production.up.railway.app/api/recordings/118/audio", "text": "घर सोड्तचि,\" यो यो मामा,\"आपय्तशिलीं तीं बब्रुलिंगप्पाक", "duration": 6.635}
{"audio_filepath": "https://konkanicollector-production.up.railway.app/api/recordings/119/audio", "text": "तांचे सांगाति वच्चें नाशिलें, सम गोत्तशिलें ताक्का", "duration": 5.3575}
{"audio_filepath": "https://konkanicollector-production.up.railway.app/api/recordings/120/audio", "text": "भवानीशङ्कर देवु येव्नु वांचय्तलो - तागलि भक्ति आशिलि पक्का!", "duration": 6.465}
{"audio_filepath": "https://konkanicollector-production.up.railway.app/api/recordings/121/audio", "text": "मोगेर येव्नु वत्ताय बब्रुलिंगप्पाक कोरूक लाग्ले", "duration": 5.3575}
{"audio_filepath": "https://konkanicollector-production.up.railway.app/api/recordings/122/audio", "text": "वग्गि वच्चां आम्मि सुरक्षित स्थळाक,\", अश्शि म्हणाले!", "duration": 4.3775}
{"audio_filepath": "https://konkanicollector-production.up.railway.app/api/recordings/123/audio", "text": "ना बा.... म्हणालो तो, तान्नि धूर वत्ता वत्ता", "duration": 4.7175}
{"audio_filepath": "https://konkanicollector-production.up.railway.app/api/recordings/124/audio", "text": "राकुनु बस्लो धृढ भक्ति ने, नामस्मरण कर्ता कर्ता", "duration": 5.805}
{"audio_filepath": "https://konkanicollector-production.up.railway.app/api/recordings/125/audio", "text": "एक पुणि संकेतु मेळो म्हुणु राकुनु बस्तना, चिक्के बेज़ार्नु-", "duration": 6.765}
{"audio_filepath": "https://konkanicollector-production.up.railway.app/api/recordings/126/audio", "text": "रक्ष कर्तले सैनिकानि यो म्हुणु आग्रह केल्लें दोणिन्तु येव्नु", "duration": 5.89}
{"audio_filepath": "https://konkanicollector-production.up.railway.app/api/recordings/127/audio", "text": "\"हांव? धन्यवादु ज़ाल्यारि ना बा!", "duration": 4.8025}
{"audio_filepath": "https://konkanicollector-production.up.railway.app/api/recordings/128/audio", "text": "समर्पण केल्यां हांवे - हांव पोळ्नु वच्च ना!", "duration": 4.61}
{"audio_filepath": "https://konkanicollector-production.up.railway.app/api/recordings/129/audio", "text": "उदाक वय्रि येत्ता येत्ता तागलें भय वाड्लें", "duration": 5.55}
{"audio_filepath": "https://konkanicollector-production.up.railway.app/api/recordings/130/audio", "text": "माडारि आशिलें खाम्बो तान्ने घटि धर्लें", "duration": 4.44}
{"audio_filepath": "https://konkanicollector-production.up.railway.app/api/recordings/131/audio", "text": "होडाने आवाहन केल्लें -\"देवा! माक्का कल्याक सोणु घाल्लें?", "duration": 4.8025}
{"audio_filepath": "https://konkanicollector-production.up.railway.app/api/recordings/132/audio", "text": "माक्का तुज्जेरि प्रीति आस्स- हांव लेक्लें तुल्याग्थाव्नु मुक्ति खण्डित मेळ्तलें \"", "duration": 6.8075}
{"audio_filepath": "https://konkanicollector-production.up.railway.app/api/recordings/133/audio", "text": "एकु आवाज़ु आय्कलो वात्सल्य आनि करुणाने भर्लेलो तावेळीचि", "duration": 6.36}
{"audio_filepath": "https://konkanicollector-production.up.railway.app/api/recordings/134/audio", "text": "\" माकाय प्रेम आस्स चेर्डा - तेमिति हांव आयिलो- तूं माक्का पळय्निचि!", "duration": 6.785}
{"audio_filepath": "https://konkanicollector-production.up.railway.app/api/recordings/135/audio", "text": "शेज़ार्चे ज़ाव्नु, कडेरि मोगेरु ज़ाव्नु आनि रक्षा सैनिकु सुद्दाय ज़ाव्नु", "duration": 6.5925}
{"audio_filepath": "https://konkanicollector-production.up.railway.app/api/recordings/136/audio", "text": "ज़ाल्यारि तूं माक्का प्रति प्हन्ता वोपस पेटय्लें, वच आत्तं म्होणु!\"", "duration": 6.435}
{"audio_filepath": "https://konkanicollector-production.up.railway.app/api/recordings/137/audio", "text": "आवाज़ु हगूर कम्मी ज़ात्ता ज़ात्ता बब्रुलिंगप्पाक कळ्ळें", "duration": 5.8675}
{"audio_filepath": "https://konkanicollector-production.up.railway.app/api/recordings/138/audio", "text": "मुख्य एकु पाठु ते दिवसु ताक्का शिक्कुक मेळ्ळें", "duration": 4.42}
{"audio_filepath": "https://konkanicollector-production.up.railway.app/api/recordings/139/audio", "text": "समर्पण म्हळ्यारि कल्लें, हाजें ताक्का ज्ञान ज़ाल्लें", "duration": 6.295}
{"audio_filepath": "https://konkanicollector-production.up.railway.app/api/recordings/140/audio", "text": "निष्ठा वाड्लि तागलि, आनि कल्ले संकेत ताक्का नाक्कशिलें", "duration": 5.825}
{"audio_filepath": "https://konkanicollector-production.up.railway.app/api/recordings/141/audio", "text": "क्षमा माग्लि तान्ने आनि याचना केल्लि कृपा खतिरि", "duration": 5.6775}
{"audio_filepath": "https://konkanicollector-production.up.railway.app/api/recordings/142/audio", "text": "हेलिकॉप्टराचे शब्दु आय्कुनु खुशालाचे हासो आय्लो तोंडारि!", "duration": 6.465}
{"audio_filepath": "https://konkanicollector-production.up.railway.app/api/recordings/143/audio", "text": "कृतज्ञतेने धर्लें तान्ने तग्गु उडय्लेले दोरि", "duration": 4.0575}
{"audio_filepath": "https://konkanicollector-production.up.railway.app/api/recordings/144/audio", "text": "हेलिकॉप्टराने सुरक्षित व्हेलें ताक्का ऊवारांथाव्नु वय्रि!", "duration": 5.485}
